  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YALI Oten Gretta Adult Learning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Education.Beneficiaries: YALI Youth 215 of 250 beneficiaries are women. (200 additional students will be enrolled and current ratio of students stands at 86% female) ..The grant will be used to assist young adults who would like to complete their secondary education. The center works with trained teachers from schools nearby to provide quality education. Classes are flexible with times in the morning, evening, or late evening. They also can study and sit for exams at the centers to earn high school diploma. The goal of the project is to scale the center, improve education quality building a more sustainable business model. The grant funds will be used to: (a) purchase classroom furniture for an increased student capacity; (b) advertising campaign to increase awareness and increase enrollment; (c) educational equipment; and (d) website development.</narrative>
  </description>
